data: {"run_id":"d6e906716a3c42ec9e2637c9c3a87fb0","seq":10,"stage":"respond","status":"ok","parent":null,"label":"10","data":{"action":"answer","system":"You are a recipe assistant in a cooking app. Answer the user's cooking question helpfully and concretely. Keep the answer under 200 words.","max_tokens":300,"max_chars":1500,"provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-haiku-4-5","text":"# Classic Lasagna Recipe\n\n## Ingredients:\n- 1 lb ground beef\n- 1 onion, diced\n- 3 garlic cloves, minced\n- 24 oz marinara sauce\n- 15 oz ricotta cheese\n- 2 cups shredded mozzarella\n- ½ cup Parmesan\n- 1 egg\n- 9 lasagna noodles\n- Salt, pepper, Italian seasoning\n\n## Instructions:\n\n1. **Brown the meat**: Sauté beef, onion, and garlic. Add marinara and simmer 15 minutes. Season to taste.\n\n2. **Make cheese mixture**: Combine ricotta, 1½ cups mozzarella, Parmesan, egg, and Italian seasoning.\n\n3. **Layer in 9x13 pan**:\n   - Thin sauce layer\n   - 3 noodles\n   - ⅓ cheese mixture\n   - ⅓ meat sauce\n   - Repeat layers twice, ending with sauce\n   - Top with remaining mozzarella\n\n4. **Bake**: Cover with foil, bake at 375°F for 25 minutes. Uncover, bake 15-20 minutes until bubbly and cheese is golden.","truncated":false,"recorded_at":"2026-10-29T14:35:33+00:00","replayed":true},"ms":2918,"tokens":347,"cost_usd":0.001547}

